A14 "One tile's journey": one instrumented ttsim that logs a single tile end to end.
Combines b05-noclog + b04-trace + b04-mop + the opcode-name table from b03-tti, and adds:
NoC commands, CB counter reads/writes (overlay stream regs), host PCIe writes/reads of DRAM,
UNPACR/ELWADD/PACR operand details and semaphore values, all into one file ($B04_OUT) in execution order.
Apply to a fresh copy:  build_ttsim.sh journey wh; cd $LAB_HOME/ttsim-journey; patch -p1 < a14-journey.patch; build_ttsim.sh journey wh
Run:  B04_OUT=$LAB_HOME/journey.trace B04_TILE=0 $EX/metal_example_eltwise_binary

